{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:53:01+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T16:53:01+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Nokia Oyj","sector":"Technology","industry":"Communication Equipment","country":"Finland","city":"Espoo","website":"https://www.nokia.com","employees":78005,"summary":"Nokia Oyj, together with its subsidiaries, provides mobile, fixed, and cloud network solutions in North and Latin America, Greater China, India, Asia Pacific, Europe, the Middle East, and Africa. It operates in four segments: Network Infrastructure, Mobile Networks, Cloud and Network Services, and Nokia Technologies. The company offers fixed network solutions, such as fiber and copper technologies, access infrastructure, in-home Wi-Fi solutions, and cloud and virtualization services; IP network solutions, which delivers IP edge routing and data center networking solutions for residential, mobile, enterprise, and cloud applications; and optical networks solutions, which provides optical transport networks for metro, regional, and long-haul applications. It also provides mobile technology products, agentic AI platform, and services for radio access networks and microwave radio links for transport networks; and network management solutions, as well as network planning, optimization, network deployment, and technical support services. In addition, the company offers cloud and network services, including open, secure, automated, and scalable software and solutions; and 5G core, secure autonomous networks, private wireless and industrial edge, and network APIs. Further, it licenses intellectual property, including patents, technologies, and the Nokia brand. The company serves its products and services to defense communications energy and resources, enterprise and industrial campus, private networks, public sector, and transportation industries. Nokia Oyj was founded in 1865 and is headquartered in Espoo, Finland.","exchange":"Helsinki","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Nokia Oyj, avec ses filiales, fournit des solutions de réseau mobile, fixe et cloud en Amérique du Nord et en Amérique latine, en Grande Chine, en Inde, en Asie-Pacifique, en Europe, au Moyen-Orient et en Afrique. Elle opère sur quatre segments : l'infrastructure réseau, les réseaux mobiles, le cloud et les services réseau, et Nokia Technologies. La société propose des solutions de réseau fixe, telles que les technologies de fibre et de cuivre, l'infrastructure d'accès, les solutions Wi-Fi à domicile et les services de cloud et de virtualisation; des solutions de réseau IP, qui fournissent des solutions de routage IP Edge et de réseau de centre de données pour les applications résidentielles, mobiles, d'entreprise et cloud; et des solutions de réseaux optiques, qui fournissent des réseaux de transport optique pour les applications métropolitaines, régionales et long-courriers."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":46815870976,"shares_outstanding":5598644598,"trailing_pe":59.728573,"forward_pe":19.604717,"price_to_book":2.2280843,"ev_to_ebitda":16.311,"ev_to_revenue":2.155,"dividend_yield":0.017,"payout_ratio":1.0,"beta_yahoo":0.735},"targets":{"current_price":8.362,"mean":10.53174,"median":10.2,"high":18.0,"low":4.65,"n_analysts":23,"reco_mean":2.52381,"reco_key":"hold"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-22"],"eps_avg":0.15364,"eps_low":0.14,"eps_high":0.17,"revenue_avg":6294927770,"ex_dividend":"2026-10-26","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.06678,"institutions_pct":0.39856,"institutions_float_pct":0.42708,"institutions_n":578,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0001,"shares":816432,"value":6827004,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.0414},{"name":"Generali Investments Cee, Investicni Spolecnost, A.s.","pct":0.0,"shares":28324,"value":236845,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total In